# Legacy System Context

This project is a rebuild of two Oracle Forms applications: **edaray** (administrative/judicial committees) and **tagded** (promotion/renewal committees). Features must match the legacy system exactly.

## Committee Workflow

1. Admin creates committee (type, date, rank, scoring weights)
2. Admin imports officer data (quarterly SQL file)
3. Admin loads members (auto-detected by job code from imported officers)
4. Admin assigns officers to be evaluated
5. Admin activates committee (one active at a time)
6. Admin activates officers one-by-one for live voting
7. Members log in and vote on the active officer
8. Admin monitors voting progress in real-time (5s polling)
9. Admin calculates final decisions
10. Admin reviews decisions, checks disputes
11. Admin prints decision card report and member credentials

## Edarya-Specific Features

- Each officer has a `ta3n_type` (case type) that determines outcome labels
- Case types: طعن (appeal), فصل (dismissal), استقالة (resignation), محو جزاء (penalty erasure), صلاحية (fitness), etc.
- Officers may have charges, judgements, settlement text, resignation text
- Additional fields: apology, eltemas_e3ada (retrial request), notes

## Tagdded-Specific Features

- Scoring uses nashra (bulletin) data from `takyeem_scores`
- Career score components: kafaa, jobs, tashkeelat, tahil, passat, awsama, gazat
- `l_lagna_type_c` determines if it's promotion vs renewal
- History/member weight split (default 60/40) is configurable per committee
- Good limit and pass limit thresholds

## Reports Must Be Pixel-Perfect

Reports (especially the decisions card - بطاقة قرارات اللجنة) must replicate the legacy Oracle Reports output exactly. These are printed and filed as official documents.
